  <Dialogue>k__BackingField:
  - text: How was the talk? Surely he praised you again. Like always.
    dialogueType: 7
    isRespondableText: 1
    successResponse: Can we talk, please?
    failureResponse: "You\u2026!"
  - text: Uh, sure.
    dialogueType: 0
    isRespondableText: 0
    successResponse: 
    failureResponse: 
  - text: "So what\u2019s up? Is something wrong? Tell me!"
    dialogueType: 4
    isRespondableText: 1
    successResponse: "Yes, I will tell you. Your uselessness cost us the deal. And
      now it\u2019s my fault."
    failureResponse: Let me tell you. You useless being.
  - text: Useless? Dude, how am I useless if you keep pushing your shit on me!
    dialogueType: 6
    isRespondableText: 0
    successResponse: 
    failureResponse: 
  - text: Who was sick for a whole week?
    dialogueType: 5
    isRespondableText: 1
    successResponse: "Being sick is a crime now\u2026?"
    failureResponse: I-
  - text: The interns are useless. Why? Because they refused to listen to me. They
      oh so love you so damn much!
    dialogueType: 7
    isRespondableText: 0
    successResponse: 
    failureResponse: 
  - text: "The manager gives you shit, now you push it to me instead? I\u2019ve always
      greeted you in the morning DAILY, and do you greet back? Of course not."
    dialogueType: 5
    isRespondableText: 0
    successResponse: 
